      "src": "F_e0 := pi^2*E/lam_0^2 = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5536
    },
    {
      "id": "r319",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "q_0 := F_y/F_e0 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5584
    },
    {
      "id": "v_elast",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "q_0 > 2.25 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5632
    },
    {
      "id": "r320",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Rama elástica, Ec. E3-3: F_n = 0,877·F_e — ya no depende de F_y",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5680
    },
    {
      "id": "r321",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "F_n0 := 0.877*F_e0 = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5728
    },
    {
      "id": "r322",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_com0 := 0.90*F_n0*A_g = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5776
    },
    {
      "id": "r323",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "u_com0 := P_uc/Rd_com0 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5824
    },
    {
      "id": "v_nopasa0",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_com0 < P_uc =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5872
    },
    {
      "id": "r400",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ 8 · NCh2369 8.6.3 — la diagonal comprimida tiene que ser dúctil ━━",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5936
    },
    {
      "id": "r401",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Tabla 9, paredes de perfiles rectangulares conformados en frío (HSS): lambda_md = 0,76·√(E/(R_y·F_y))",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 5984
    },
    {
      "id": "r402",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "F_ye := R_y*F_y = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6032
    },
    {
      "id": "r403",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "lam_md := 0.76*sqrt(E/F_ye) =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6080
    },
    {
      "id": "v_lammd",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "lam_w < lam_md =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6128
    },
    {
      "id": "r404",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "8.6.3, esbeltez global: L_c/r < 1,5·π·√(E/F_y)",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6176
    },
    {
      "id": "r405",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "lam_nch := 1.5*pi*sqrt(E/F_y) =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6224
    },
    {
      "id": "v_esbnch",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "lam_c < lam_nch =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6272
    },
    {
      "id": "r406",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "1,5π = 4,712 y AISC parte el régimen en 4,71: el límite de 8.6.3 ES el quiebre elástico/inelástico",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6320
    },
    {
      "id": "r407",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "dif_lim := abs(lam_nch/lam_lim - 1) =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6368
    },
    {
      "id": "v_mismo",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "dif_lim < 0.001 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6416
    },
    {
      "id": "r408",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Corolario: 8.6.3 le exige a la diagonal pandear en régimen inelástico. Sin el cruce, L/r no cumple:",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6464
    },
    {
      "id": "v_esbnch0",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "lam_0 > lam_nch =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6512
    },
    {
      "id": "r409",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "La exención de 8.6.3 —diseñar con el sismo amplificado por 0,7R_1— tampoco abre esa puerta:",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6560
    },
    {
      "id": "r410",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "P_ex := 0.7*R_1*P_E = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6608
    },
    {
      "id": "r411",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "u_ex0 := P_ex/Rd_com0 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6656
    },
    {
      "id": "v_ex0",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "P_ex > Rd_com0 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6704
    },
    {
      "id": "r500",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "━━ 9 · NCh2369 8.6.8 — la conexión desarrolla las capacidades esperadas (8.3.1) ━━",
      "pageBreak": true,
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6768
    },
    {
      "id": "r501",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "F_ue := R_t*F_u = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6816
    },
    {
      "id": "r502",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "T_ye := F_ye*A_g = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6864
    },
    {
      "id": "r503",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "8.3.1: F_cre es F_cr evaluado con F_ye en lugar de F_y, y P_ne lleva el factor 1,14",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6912
    },
    {
      "id": "r504",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "q_e := F_ye/F_e =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 6960
    },
    {
      "id": "r505",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "F_cre := F_ye*0.658^q_e = kgf/cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7008
    },
    {
      "id": "r506",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "P_ne := 1.14*F_cre*A_g = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7056
    },
    {
      "id": "r507",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Techo de 8.6.8: la combinación de 4.5 con el sísmico horizontal amplificado por 0,7R_1 ≥ 1,0",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7104
    },
    {
      "id": "v_techo",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "P_ex > T_ye =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7152
    },
    {
      "id": "r508",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "El techo solo alivia si la sobrerresistencia de la sección supera 0,7R_1 = 2,80",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7200
    },
    {
      "id": "r509",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "sobrer := T_ye/P_E =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7248
    },
    {
      "id": "r510",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "T_req := min(T_ye, P_ex) = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7296
    },
    {
      "id": "r511",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "C8.3.1 permite F_ye/F_ue en estados de falla interiores al elemento que desarrolla su capacidad (mismo material)",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7344
    },
    {
      "id": "r512",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "La soldadura es otro material: sigue con F_EXX nominal y phi = 0,75",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7392
    },
    {
      "id": "r513",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Tope absoluto de la rotura del área neta, aun con U = 1 (soldadura infinitamente larga)",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7440
    },
    {
      "id": "r514",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_tope := 0.75*F_ue*A_n = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7488
    },
    {
      "id": "v_tope",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_tope < T_req =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7536
    },
    {
      "id": "r515",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Y es un tope de la configuración, no del tamaño: haría falta U ≥ R_y·F_y/(0,75·R_t·F_u), que es > 1",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7584
    },
    {
      "id": "r516",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "U_req := (R_y*F_y)/(0.75*R_t*F_u) =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7632
    },
    {
      "id": "v_imposible",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "U_req > 1 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7680
    },
    {
      "id": "r517",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "→ hay que reponer área con planchas de refuerzo en la ranura, y alargar el cordón",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7728
    },
    {
      "id": "r518",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "l_w2 := 30 cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7776
    },
    {
      "id": "r519",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_sol2 := 4*Rn_cm*l_w2 = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7824
    },
    {
      "id": "v_sol2",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_sol2 >= T_req =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7872
    },
    {
      "id": "v_solc",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_sol2 >= P_ne =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7920
    },
    {
      "id": "r520",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Hipótesis declarada: U se toma del Caso 5 del tubo desnudo; el refuerzo es simétrico sobre las dos paredes ranuradas",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 7968
    },
    {
      "id": "r521",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "U_2 := 1 - x_bar/l_w2 =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8016
    },
    {
      "id": "r522",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Ae_req := T_req/(0.75*F_ue) = cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8064
    },
    {
      "id": "r523",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "An_req := Ae_req/U_2 = cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8112
    },
    {
      "id": "r524",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "dA := An_req - A_n = cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8160
    },
    {
      "id": "r525",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "La ranura corta también el refuerzo: dos planchuelas por pared ranurada, cuatro en total",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8208
    },
    {
      "id": "r536",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Cada pared deja (B - w_r)/2 = 4.1 cm de plano a cada lado de la ranura",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8256
    },
    {
      "id": "r526",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "t_pl := 0.8 cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8304
    },
    {
      "id": "r527",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "b_pl := 3.0 cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8352
    },
    {
      "id": "r537",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "b_disp := (B - w_r)/2 = cm",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8400
    },
    {
      "id": "v_bpl",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "b_pl <= b_disp =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8448
    },
    {
      "id": "r528",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "A_pl := 4*t_pl*b_pl = cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8496
    },
    {
      "id": "v_pl",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "A_pl >= dA =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8544
    },
    {
      "id": "r529",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "An_ref := A_n + A_pl = cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8592
    },
    {
      "id": "r530",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Ae_ref := An_ref*U_2 = cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8640
    },
    {
      "id": "r531",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_ref := 0.75*F_ue*Ae_ref = tonf",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8688
    },
    {
      "id": "v_ref",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Rd_ref >= T_req =",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8736
    },
    {
      "id": "r532",
      "kind": "text",
      "src": "Corte de bloque con las propiedades esperadas (mismo material) sobre el cordón largo",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8784
    },
    {
      "id": "r533",
      "kind": "math",
      "src": "Agv2 := 4*l_w2*t_d = cm^2",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 8832
    },
